# Freelancer Contract Generation

Generate and export 2 types of contracts for freelancer employees, with a **project name** input field since one freelancer can have multiple contracts for different projects.

## Contract Types
1. **HĐKV** – Hợp đồng Khoán việc (Service/Freelancer Contract, 7 pages)
2. **NDA CTV** – Thỏa thuận Bảo mật Thông tin (Confidentiality Agreement for Freelancer, 3 pages)

